§ 1º), quotecheck 5 (quotation marks in the Code's text: 'visto', 'sem recurso'), missorig 1 (art. 644: the page gives no 1973 wording), latecaput (incisos and paragraphs unchanged under a rewritten caput). Merged scratch build: 296 acts, 4046 versions, 2826 commits, check.py 0 mismatches, 0 trailer errors, --compare identical, audit_push clean on main and futuro.
